      <draw:handle draw:handle-range-x-maximum="?f1" draw:handle-range-x-minimum="0" draw:handle-position="?f5 0"/>
     </draw:enhanced-geometry>
    </draw:custom-shape><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr2" draw:name="Image3" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="5.9846in" svg:height="2.5575in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB01/4.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
     <svg:desc>Capture d&apos;écran d&apos;une description d&apos;

s informatiques générée automatiquement</svg:desc>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum10">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P15" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T3">Vous avez le choix entre un fichier zip et un fichier msi. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">Téléchargez le fichier .msi</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, car il est livré avec son propre programme d&apos;installation. </text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P13" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P17" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Le fichier que vous téléchargerez portera un nom de fichier comme ceci :</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P57" loext:marker-style-name="T6"><text:span text:style-name="T6">zulu17.44.15-ca-jdk17.0.8-win_x64.msi</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="List_20_Paragraph" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3"><text:line-break/> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum10">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P15" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T6">Double-cliquez sur le fichier msi</text:span> «<text:span text:style-name="T3"> » et suivez les instructions de l&apos;assistant d&apos;installation pour l&apos;installer. Par défaut, le programme d&apos;installation de .msi installe le JDK dans le dossier suivant :</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P58" loext:marker-style-name="T29"><text:span text:style-name="T29">C:\Program Files\Zulu\zulu-17\</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P59" loext:marker-style-name="T29"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P59" loext:marker-style-name="T29"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P60" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T9">Important</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">: Si vous remplacez le dossier d&apos;installation du JDK par un autre dossier que le dossier par défaut, vous devrez vous souvenir de l&apos;emplacement du dossier afin de pouvoir indiquer à Scripture App Builder où trouver le JDK.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P8" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140709"/>Installation du kit de développement logiciel (SDK) Android<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140709"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P53" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Le troisième composant nécessaire au développement d&apos;applications Android est le kit de développement logiciel (SDK) Android. Il existe deux façons d&apos;installer le SDK Android :</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum11">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P18" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T8">En ligne</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5"> : téléchargez les packages Android SDK à partir d&apos;Internet : </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"><text:line-break/>utilisez l&apos;assistant d&apos;installation Android SDK pour télécharger et installer les outils de ligne de commande et trois packages supplémentaires. Cette méthode nécessitera une connexion Internet. </text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Voir 2.3.1 pour plus de détails.<text:line-break/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum11">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P18" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T8">Hors ligne</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">: copiez les fichiers du SDK Android de quelqu&apos;un d&apos;autre :</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"><text:line-break/>Si vous connaissez quelqu&apos;un qui a déjà téléchargé et installé le SDK Android, vous pouvez copier tous les fichiers de celui-ci. </text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Cette méthode est particulièrement utile dans un atelier de formation où plusieurs personnes doivent installer le SDK mais disposent d&apos;une bande passante Internet limitée. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T3">Voir 2.3.2 pour plus de détails.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140710"/><text:span text:style-name="T3">Téléchargement des paquets du SDK Android à partir d&apos;Internet</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140710"/><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">To install the Android SDK from the internet: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum4">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P63" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Lancez </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">Scripture App Builder</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">. </text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P43" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum4">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P63" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Cliquez sur </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">le bouton « Installer le SDK Android » </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">sur la page d&apos;accueil (ou sélectionnez </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">Outils</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">d&apos;installation du SDK Android</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> dans le menu principal).</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P13" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum4">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P64" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T3">Suivez les instructions de chaque page de l&apos;assistant d&apos;installation du </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">SDK Android</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> pour télécharger chacun des paquets du SDK Android et les installer.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P44" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P61" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Lorsqu&apos;il vous est demandé de spécifier un dossier cible, il est recommandé d&apos;indiquer </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">C:\sdk</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P45" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P65" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Quatre packages seront téléchargés et installés :</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum12">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P20" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Command line tools, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P20" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Build Tools, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P20" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Platform Tools, and </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P20" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">API de la plate-forme.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P44" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:soft-page-break/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P62" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Si l&apos;installation a réussi, les numéros de version s&apos;affichent en vert.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P46" loext:marker-style-name="T5"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P66" loext:marker-style-name="T30"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P33" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr2" draw:name="Image4" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="5.9846in" svg:height="3.8571in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB01/5.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
    </draw:frame><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3"><text:line-break/>Si l&apos;un des outils de génération, des outils de plate-forme ou de l&apos;API de plate-forme est répertorié comme « Introuvable » (affiché en rouge), accédez aux </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">Outils</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T27"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">Paramètres</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, sélectionnez </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">l&apos;onglet SDK Android</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> et cliquez sur</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">le bouton « Installer les paquets »</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> pour les installer.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Cliquez sur </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">le bouton « Vérifier l&apos;installation »</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> pour confirmer que tous les paquets ont été correctement installés.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T3">Vous pouvez sauter la section 2.3.2 et aller directement à la section 2.4.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P47" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140711"/><text:span text:style-name="T3">Copier les fichiers du SDK Android provenant d&apos;une autre personne</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140711"/><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Si vous connaissez quelqu&apos;un qui a déjà téléchargé et installé le SDK Android et qui réussit à créer des applications avec, vous pouvez copier tous ses fichiers SDK Android dans un dossier de votre ordinateur.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P67" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Vous devez rechercher le dossier SDK Android de niveau supérieur, tel que </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">c:\sdk</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, et copier l&apos;intégralité du dossier et son contenu sur votre ordinateur. Un emplacement tel que c:\sdk est bon. Si cela vous facilite la tâche, vous pouvez compresser les dossiers, puis les décompresser sur votre ordinateur.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P67" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Notez qu&apos;il n&apos;y a </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">pas de programme d&apos;installation à exécuter</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">. Il suffit de copier les fichiers d&apos;un ordinateur à un autre.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P67" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T5">Astuce</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> : Un dossier SDK Android typique peut être assez volumineux (plus de 1 Go, selon les packages supplémentaires qui ont été installés). Pour créer une application, vous n&apos;avez pas besoin de tous les fichiers SDK Android. Si vous souhaitez réduire le nombre de fichiers, voici une liste des dossiers essentiels et facultatifs :</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <table:table table:name="Table1" table:style-name="Table1">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table1.A"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table1.B"/>
    <table:table-header-rows>
     <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T31"><text:span text:style-name="T31">Dossier SDK Android</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T31"/></text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T31"><text:span text:style-name="T31">Requis pour la création d&apos;applications ?</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T31"/></text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
     </table:table-row>
    </table:table-header-rows>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">cmdline-tools (or tools)</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.B2" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">Yes</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A3" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">build-tools</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.B3" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">Oui (vous n&apos;avez besoin du sous-dossier que pour la dernière version)</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A4" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">platforms</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.B4" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">Oui (vous n&apos;avez besoin que d&apos;android-36)</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <text:soft-page-break/>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A5" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">platform-tools</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.B5" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">Oui</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A6" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">add-ons</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.B6" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">Non</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A7" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">docs</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.B7" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">Non</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <text:soft-page-break/>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A8" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">emulator</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.B8" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">Non, sauf si vous souhaitez utiliser un émulateur</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A9" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">extras</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.B9" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">Non</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A10" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">licenses</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.B10" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">Oui</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <text:soft-page-break/>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A11" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">sources</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.B11" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">Non</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A12" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">system-images</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.B12" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">Non, sauf si vous souhaitez utiliser un émulateur</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="Table1.1">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A13" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">temp</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.B13" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P68" loext:marker-style-name="T32"><text:span text:style-name="T32">Non</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T32"/></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P8" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc44921079"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140712"/>Installation <text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc44921079"/>d&apos;aeneas pour la synchronisation audio-texte<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140712"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P69" loext:marker-style-name="T21"><text:span text:style-name="T21">Scripture App Builder utilise un outil appelé </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T24">aeneas</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T21"> pour synchroniser le texte et l&apos;audio.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P70" loext:marker-style-name="T21"><text:span text:style-name="T21">Pour configurer </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T23">aeneas</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T21"> sous Windows, il y a plusieurs programmes et modules à télécharger et à installer : FFmpeg, eSpeak, Python et aeneas. Ceux-ci sont installés à l&apos;aide d&apos;un seul programme d&apos;installation.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum9">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P22" loext:marker-style-name="T18"><text:span text:style-name="T18">Allez sur la page </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T22">de téléchargement</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18"> sur le site Web de Scripture App Builder </text:span><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="http://software.sil.org/scriptureappbuilder/download/" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link"><text:span text:style-name="T18">http://software.sil.org/scriptureappbuilder/download</text:span></text:span></text:a><text:span text:style-name="T18"> et téléchargez le dernier programme d&apos;installation d&apos;Énée pour Windows. Vous le trouverez dans la rubrique «</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T22">Outils de synchronisation audio » d&apos;</text:span> <text:span text:style-name="T18">.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P23" loext:marker-style-name="T18"><text:span text:style-name="T18">Le nom du fichier sera quelque chose comme </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T22">aeneas-windows-setup-1.7.3.exe</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P25" loext:marker-style-name="T18"/>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum9">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P22" loext:marker-style-name="T18"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T18">Double-cliquez sur le fichier que vous avez téléchargé pour démarrer l&apos;assistant d&apos;installation.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P26" loext:marker-style-name="T18"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P27" loext:marker-style-name="T18"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr2" draw:name="Image 4" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="4.5075in" svg:height="3.4957in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB01/6.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
    </draw:frame><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P26" loext:marker-style-name="T18"/>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum9">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P24" loext:marker-style-name="T18"><text:span text:style-name="T18">Suivez les instructions de l&apos;assistant. Vous pouvez accepter toutes les valeurs par défaut. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P25" loext:marker-style-name="T18"><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum9">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P22" loext:marker-style-name="T18"><text:span text:style-name="T18">Sur la page </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T22">page « Sélectionner les composants »</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">, vous avez besoin de </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T22">l&apos;installation complète</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18"> qui doit être sélectionnée par défaut.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P27" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr2" draw:name="Image 11" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="4.5134in" svg:height="3.5in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB01/7.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
    </draw:frame><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:soft-page-break/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum9">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P21" loext:marker-style-name="T18"><text:span text:style-name="T18">Sur la page</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T22">Prêt pour l&apos;installation</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18"> , cliquez sur </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T22">Installer</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P71" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Vous verrez l&apos;assistant exécuter plusieurs installateurs différents : pour FFmpeg, eSpeak et Python. Il installera également trois modules Python.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P43" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P71" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Avant la fin de l&apos;assistant, vous devriez voir apparaître une boîte de commande pendant quelques secondes qui vérifie l&apos;installation d&apos;aeneas. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P43" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P35" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr2" draw:name="Picture 12" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="4.3335in" svg:height="2.1965in" draw:z-index="0"><draw:image xlink:href="SAB01/8.png" xlink:type="simple" xlink:show="embed" xlink:actuate="onLoad" draw:mime-type="image/png"/>
    </draw:frame><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P43" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:soft-page-break/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P43" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:s/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P72" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T9">Important</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> : Si Scripture App Builder était ouverte pendant que vous installiez aeneas, fermez-le et redémarrez-le pour vous assurer qu&apos;il prend en compte les modifications apportées à vos paramètres de chemin.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P6" text:outline-level="1" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140713"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="OLE_LINK5"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="OLE_LINK2"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="OLE_LINK1"/><text:span text:style-name="T3">Linux Installation</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140713"/><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P52" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Pour exécuter Scripture App Builder sur Windows, vous devez avoir 3 composants installés sur votre ordinateur :</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum5">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P74" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Créateur d&apos;applications d&apos;écriture</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P73" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Kit de développement Java OpenJDK (JDK)</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P73" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Kit de développement logiciel (SDK) Android</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">There are two ways to install Scripture App Builder for Linux:</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum15">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P28" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://flathub.org/" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Flathub</text:span></text:span></text:a><text:span text:style-name="T3">: The Linux App Store – available for many distributions of Linux</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P28" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://packages.sil.org/" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link"><text:span text:style-name="T3">SIL repository for Ubuntu</text:span></text:span></text:a> <text:span text:style-name="T3">– available for some versions of Ubuntu-based distributions (including </text:span><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://www.wastalinux.org/" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Wasta-Linux</text:span></text:span></text:a><text:span text:style-name="T3">) </text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:h text:style-name="P8" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140714"/><text:soft-page-break/>Flathub<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140714"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Flathub is required for Ubuntu 24.04 (Noble) and newer or other non-Ubuntu distributions. To install using Flathub, follow the installation instructions at </text:span><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://flathub.org/setup" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link"><text:span text:style-name="T3">https://flathub.org/setup</text:span></text:span></text:a><text:span text:style-name="T3"> for your specific distribution. Search for Scripture App Builder in the distribution-specific store. You will need to install the JDK and Android SDK separately. </text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum16">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P29" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">To install the JDK, see section 2.2.1 Installing the JDK using the Install wizard.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P29" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">To install the Android SDK, see section 2.3.1 Downloading the Android SDK packages from the internet.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:h text:style-name="P8" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140715"/>SIL repository for Ubuntu<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140715"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Hlk534311954"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">The Ubuntu-based package for Scripture App Builder already includes the dependencies on the package for OpenJDK and a package that will download the Android SDK from the internet and install it. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">You have the following installation options for how the Android SDK is installed:</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum8">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P30" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T3">Follow the instructions in section 3.2.2 to download everything directly from the Internet.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P30" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Follow the instructions in sections 3.2.3 through 3.2.5 to download the Android SDK files before installing the packages.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P30" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Follow the instructions in section 3.2.6 if you already have the Android SDK installed and you do not want another copy installed.</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="_Hlk534311954"/><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140716"/>Add SIL repository for Ubuntu<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140716"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">To install packages from the SIL repository for Ubuntu, the repository must be added to the APT sources. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T10">Note: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">Wasta-Linux</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> already includes configuration for the SIL repository for Ubuntu and so you can skip this section.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Si vous utilisez une autre </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">distribution basée sur Ubuntu</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">, veuillez suivre les instructions ci-dessous (de la section « Activer l&apos;accès aux logiciels SIL et aux polices dans Ubuntu » sur </text:span><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://packages.sil.org/" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link"><text:span text:style-name="T3">https://packages.sil.org</text:span></text:span></text:a><text:span text:style-name="T3">).</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:soft-page-break/></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="WWNum6">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P31" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Ouvrez une fenêtre de terminal.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P13" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum6">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P31" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Ajoutez la clé de sécurité du référentiel :</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">(wget -O- https://packages.sil.org/keys/pso-keyring-2016.gpg | sudo tee /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/pso-keyring-2016.gpg)&amp;&gt;/dev/null</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P13" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="WWNum6">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P31" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Ajouter la source :</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="Command_20_Line" loext:marker-style-name="T33"><text:span text:style-name="T33">(. /etc/os-release &amp;&amp; sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/packages-sil-org.list&gt;/dev/null &lt;&lt;&lt; &quot;deb http://packages.sil.org/$ID $VERSION_CODENAME main&quot;)</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33"/></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140717"/>Installation de tous les paquets à partir d&apos;Internet<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140717"/><text:bookmark text:name="OLE_LINK10"/><text:bookmark text:name="OLE_LINK9"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P75" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T3">Pour installer tous les logiciels nécessaires à partir de la ligne de commande, tapez :</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P5">sudo apt-get update</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Command_20_Line">sudo apt-get install -y scripture-app-builder</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Remarque : </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">Wasta-Linux</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> n&apos;installe pas automatiquement les paquets recommandés. Pour que tout soit installé, installez également android-sdk-installer.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Command_20_Line"><text:bookmark-start text:name="OLE_LINK3"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="OLE_LINK4"/>sudo apt-get install -y scripture-app-builder android-sdk-installer</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-end text:name="OLE_LINK3"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="OLE_LINK4"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140718"/>Téléchargement des fichiers SDK Android avant l&apos;installation du package<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140718"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Le paquet</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">android-sdk-installer</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> facilite le téléchargement et l&apos;installation du SDK Android. Son comportement par défaut est de télécharger les fichiers appropriés à partir du référentiel de logiciels Android de Google lors de l&apos;installation. Si cela pose un problème en raison de l&apos;utilisation de la bande passante pendant l&apos;installation, les fichiers peuvent être téléchargés avant l&apos;installation.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140719"/><text:span text:style-name="T3">Téléchargement des fichiers SDK Android</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140719"/><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T3">Sur un ordinateur connecté à Internet, utilisez les instructions de ligne de commande suivantes pour créer un nouveau dossier et télécharger 4 fichiers ZIP (environ 400 Mo). </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Command_20_Line">mkdir -p ~/Downloads/android-sdk-zips</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Command_20_Line">cd ~/Downloads/android-sdk-zips</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Command_20_Line">wget -ci http://bit.ly/android-sdk-urls</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P76" loext:marker-style-name="T34"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Remarque : l&apos;option -c permet de reprendre les téléchargements en cas d&apos;échec en cours de téléchargement.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P76" loext:marker-style-name="T34"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140720"/><text:span text:style-name="T3">Fournir des fichiers ZIP lors de l&apos;installation du package</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140720"/><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P77" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Utilisez </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">debconf</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> pour pré-amorcer le paquet avec l&apos;emplacement des fichiers et installer le paquet.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Command_20_Line"><text:soft-page-break/>echo android-sdk-installer android-sdk-installer/dldir string ~/Downloads/android-sdk-zips | sudo debconf-set-selections</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Command_20_Line">sudo apt-get install android-sdk-installer</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Command_20_Line">echo android-sdk-installer android-sdk-installer/dldir string | sudo debconf-set-selections</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P76" loext:marker-style-name="T34"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140721"/>Installation sans le SDK Android<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140721"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Le paquet </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">android-sdk-installer</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> est un paquet recommandé pour le paquet </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">scripture-app-builder</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">. Si le SDK Android est déjà installé, Scripture App Builder peut utiliser l&apos;installation actuelle.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Command_20_Line">sudo apt-get update</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Command_20_Line">sudo apt-get install scripture-app-builder --no-install-recommends</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P78" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T3">Set the ANDROID_HOME environment variable to the path of the Android SDK installation to allow Scripture App Builder to find it automatically. Otherwise you can use the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">Tools</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T27"></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">Settings</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> dialog in Scripture App Builder to specify the path.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140722"/>Automating Android SDK installation<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140722"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">Le programme d&apos;installation « </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T5">android-sdk-installer</text:span> »<text:span text:style-name="T3"> vous invite à accepter la licence du SDK Android. Pour automatiser l&apos;installation (par exemple dans un playbook Ansible), préamorcez la réponse à cette question.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3">echo android-sdk-installer android-sdk-installer/accepted-android-sdk-eula boolean true | sudo debconf-set-selections</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Command_20_Line">sudo apt-get install android-sdk-installer</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P7" text:outline-level="1" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:bookmark-end text:name="OLE_LINK1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="OLE_LINK5"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="OLE_LINK2"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc227140723"/><text:span text:style-name="T3">How to build your first app</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc227140723"/><text:span text:style-name="T3"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T3"><text:span text:style-name="T3">To build your first app with Scripture App Builder, follow the instructions in the first chapter of the document </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">‘Scripture App Builder – 2 Building Apps’</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39" loext:marker-style-name="T3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P79" loext:marker-style-name="T35"/>
  </office:text>
 </office:body>
</office:document>